sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant FE as Browser
    participant Sub as /api/subscriptions/payments/vnpay
    participant Pay as VNPay Gateway
    participant DB as Payment/Subscription/User
    participant Mail as EmailService

    User->>FE: Choose Premium
    FE->>Sub: POST create VNPay payment
    Sub->>DB: Create Payment(pending)
    Sub-->>FE: paymentUrl
    FE->>Pay: Redirect to VNPay
    Pay-->>FE: Redirect back with query params
    FE->>Sub: GET /vnpay/return
    Sub->>Pay: verifyReturnUrl
    alt Verified success
        Sub->>DB: Mark paid; upsert Subscription; update User.plan
        Sub->>Mail: sendPaymentResultEmail(success)
        Sub-->>FE: Redirect /thank-you?paymentStatus=success
    else Failure
        Sub->>DB: Mark failed
        Sub->>Mail: sendPaymentResultEmail(failed)
        Sub-->>FE: Redirect /?paymentStatus=failed
    end
    Pay->>Sub: IPN callback (later)
    Sub->>Pay: verifyIpnCall
    Sub->>DB: Update payment/subscription accordingly
    Sub-->>Pay: IpnSuccess/FailChecksum
